# AnkiLearning — environment notes
#
# This app uses a BRING-YOUR-OWN-KEY (BYOK) model for AI features:
# there is NO default/shared Gemini API key, and no key is baked into the
# client bundle at build time.
#
# Each user enters their own Gemini API key inside the app:
#   Settings → Gemini API Key
# The key is stored on the user's own account and used directly from
# their browser. Default model: gemini-2.5-flash.
# Fallback model: gemini-2.5-flash-lite.
#
# Do NOT add GEMINI_API_KEY / GOOGLE_API_KEY / VITE_* key variables here
# expecting them to reach the client — the build deliberately does not
# embed any API key (see vite.config.ts).
